   "announcedAt": "2023-10-20T03:23:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. On boot, the language will default to the system language (if supported) instead of English.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed an issue where discarding a slice of meat made players unable to progress. Now you can get more meat if you need it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Improved ring visibility with a touch of sparkle to help players find it that little bit easier.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Improved Ranjit's movement in the forest. No more getting stuck!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Slight Spanish (Latinamerica) localisation fix: replacing 'Hogar' with 'Chimenea'",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
